---

This project is based on NetworkAdapterSelector by Soroush Falahati,
originally licensed under GPL-2.0.
https://github.com/falahati/NetworkAdapterSelector

The core injection technique has been rewritten and extended under MIT License
with the following significant changes:
- Removed SupportsMulticast restriction (enables WireGuard and Tailscale support)
- Complete WPF GUI with MVVM architecture
- JSON profile system for persistent rules
- WMI-based auto-injection on process start
- System tray integration and startup support
- Inno Setup installer with proper uninstall support
